    "sentence_translations": [
      "Cyber Valentine’s Day",
      "",
      "In China, May 20th each year is called “Cyber Valentine’s Day”.",
      "This is because in Chinese, “five” sounds like “I”, “two” sounds like “love” and “zero” sounds like “you”.",
      "Therefore, “520” developed a new meaning: “I love you”.",
      "It differs from traditional festivals such as Spring Festival and Qingming Festival, ..",
      ".. since Cyber Valentine’s Day only started to become popular in China in recent years.",
      "On May the 20th, many couples will go on dates, and many people also choose to get married on this day.",
